  "input_and_forward_pass_specification": {
    "tokenizer": "ProsusAI/finbert",
    "chunk_tokens": 384,
    "chunk_stride": 64,
    "train_max_chunks": 2,
    "eval_max_chunks": 4,
    "forward_pass_procedure": "For an earnings announcement on date t for symbol S with transcript T: (1) Tokenize T into chunks of 384 tokens with stride 64, taking up to 4 chunks. (2) Perform 32 Monte Carlo forward passes with variational sampling enabled (a = mu_a + sigma_a * eps_a, b = mu_b + sigma_b * eps_b). (3) For each MC pass, compute softmax probabilities for class 1 across chunks and average across chunks to obtain document probability p_m. (4) Posterior mean = mean(p_m, m=1..32); epistemic variance = var(p_m, m=1..32)."
  },
